    text: "Bounded touched quick run finished in 12m56.28s: 264 tests, 263 pass and one import-order audit failure caused by helper imports preceding isolate-session. Corrected import order in every touched entrypoint without weakening the audit. Targeted environment/isolation audit now passes 2/2 (144 entrypoints, 219 explicit child launch sites, six embedded workers), and workflow/depth tests pass 11/11 again in 12.34s. All seeded lifecycle, destruction, admission, diff and derivation assertions in the original focused run passed; no full local depth or coverage was attempted. Quick history regressions pass 3/3 and fixture lifecycle regressions pass 7/7 as previously recorded. Both committed self-host acceptance rounds pass. Changelog consistency and strict health pass with the workflow-pinned project extension and an isolated global profile. The ordinary local profile exposes the pre-existing global extension skew tracked by pm-vcs-5lre; no shared settings were changed."
  - created_at: "2026-11-15T13:32:11.653Z"
