    text: "Implementation handoff: PR https://github.com/unbraind/pm-vcs/pull/209 . Existing queued implementation run 43719295160 and CodeQL run 43719295147 will be superseded by the import-order correction. Watch budget ends 30 minutes after the initial PR run was created (13:51 UTC). Queue-inclusive completed-job wall times cannot yet be measured. Coverage at unchanged thresholds, complete quick PR runtime, deep full-depth runtime and native Windows execution remain CI evidence gaps. One gate per job removes #154 sequential accumulation; the preserved 20 GiB preflight may still reject insufficient runners. CodeQL is not required. Release workflow, pm-github workflows, verifier scripts, protection and variables remain untouched."
