    text: "Bounded Jobs API evidence at 2026-11-16 05:10:09 UTC. Pushed repair head 3aad664294c16f98e533eb290ff316d167acd3e2, latest run 43807420296. Fourteen shards per Node line, parallel non-coverage gates, exact c8 merge and unchanged Windows checks. Full-suite merged coverage and required aggregates remain pending. Repaired local workflow/merge fixtures pass 11/11; durability audit, typecheck/build:test, lint, duplication and docstrings pass. Source scope and --all --100 --per-file thresholds are unchanged.\n\nLatest-head snapshot (only completed durations are reported):\n\n| Job | Result | Created to completion | Execution |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| changes | success | 22s | 20s |\n| coverage-shard (26, 1) | in_progress | unfinished | unfinished |\n| coverage-shard (26, 2) | success | 430s | 381s |\n| coverage-shard (26, 3) | in_progress | unfinished | unfinished |\n| coverage-shard (26, 4) | in_progress | unfinished | unfinished |\n| coverage-shard (26, 5) | in_progress | unfinished | unfinished |\n| coverage-shard (26, 6) | success | 392s | 327s |\n| coverage-shard (26, 7) | success | 151s | 128s |\n| coverage-shard (26, 8) | success | 485s | 343s |\n| coverage-shard (26, 9) | in_progress | unfinished | unfinished |\n| coverage-shard (26, 10) | success | 465s | 228s |\n| coverage-shard (26, 11) | in_progress | unfinished | unfinished |\n| coverage-shard (26, 12) | queued | unfinished | unfinished |\n| coverage-shard (26, 13) | success | 322s | 250s |\n| coverage-shard (26, 14) | success | 488s | 88s |\n| quick-shard (22, 1) | in_progress | unfinished | unfinished |\n| quick-shard (22, 2) | in_progress | unfinished | unfinished |\n| quick-shard (22, 3) | in_progress | unfinished | unfinished |\n| quick-shard (22, 4) | in_progress | unfinished | unfinished |\n| quick-shard (22, 5) | in_progress | unfinished | unfinished |\n| quick-shard (22, 6) | queued | unfinished | unfinished |\n| quick-shard (22, 7) | in_progress | unfinished | unfinished |\n| quick-s