    edited_at: "2026-11-16T05:10:12.914Z"
  - created_at: "2026-11-16T05:13:07.922Z"
    author: codex-sol
    text: "Final harness repair: direct Node shard commands lacked the npm script PATH, so PM CLI integration witnesses could skip. Both shard matrices now publish node_modules/.bin via GITHUB_PATH after npm ci. The local shard workflow contracts pass 6/6 and build:test passes. This restores the existing npm test environment without weakening assertions, changing product behavior, thresholds, source scope or Windows jobs. New hosted results remain pending; stopping CI observation after publishing this fix rather than starting another wait cycle. The preceding per-job timing tables retain their exact measured heads."
  - created_at: "2026-11-16T05:37:40.835Z"
    author: codex-sol
    text: "Follow-up on PR #209: pulled branch fast-forward-only at c342e00. Inspecting run 43808985868 merged refs.ts branch misses before changing thresholds or coverage identities; will reduce shard count from measured per-file timings, run focused checks and self-host acceptance, push under the shared-runner hold, and observe at most 30 minutes after the last push."
  - created_at: "2026-11-16T05:44:15.410Z"
    author: codex-sol
    text: "Root cause (b): merged branch 147 at engine/refs.ts:299:31-45 has [0]; every one of 14 shard hits reports [0] at that same location. Existing cleanup test fails during validation before completed-batch release error propagation. Added a deterministic two-ref completed-batch release failure test, asserting first-error identity, both published refs, every released lock and closed descriptor. No threshold or merge identity changes. Sizing from complete run: 4145s coverage steps and 3457s quick steps; per-file maximum costs plus allocated process overhead total 4278.148s. With 120s setup reserve, seven-way ideal minimum is 731.164s; eight largest-first bins project max 654.960s. Shared allocator discovers all files dynamically (new files estimated 60s). N=8 reduces CI from 35 to 23 jobs; no single file dominates (largest about 260s)."
  - created_at: "2026-11-16T05:50:38.186Z"
    author: codex-sol
    text: "Local proof passed: npm run typecheck; npm run build:test; npm run lint; PM_TEST_DEPTH=quick node --test --test-concurrency=1 test/coverage-merge.test.ts test/ci-shards.test.ts test/ci-codeql.test.ts test/ci-routing.test.ts test/dependency-refresh-workflow.test.ts test/test-environment.test.ts test/refs.test.ts. The linked PM test run returned exit 0, 40 passed, zero failed/cancelled/skipped/todo (310.645s including checks; tests 218.264s). Strict unique-key YAML parses are included in workflow tests; actionlint is unavailable. Diagnostic c8 union of original raw refs ranges plus the new single-test witness reaches refs.ts 100/100/100/100, with one hit at 299:31-45. This diagnostic mixes hosted Node 26.13.1 and local 26.13.0 and is not full-suite certification. Regenerating the staged self-host snapshot now, then verifying the committed archive before pushing; hosted measurements remain pending."
  - created_at: "2026-11-16T05:55:24.704Z"
    author: codex-sol
    text: "Pushed code head 5660350ce41c1ecaed123c39c73b468f89d278cf after the shared-runner hold expired. npm run self-host:write regenerated the staged source snapshot; npm run accept:self-host passed against the committed bundle and source. Additional Node 22.23.4 runtime smoke discovers all 148 test files exactly once, 18-19 per balanced shard. Hosted CI run 43813269377 is queued; observation cutoff is 06:24 UTC (30 minutes after the push). PR body now records root cause, sizing, 23-job structure and local proof. Hosted metrics and coverage remain pending."
  - created_at: "2026-11-16T06:19:32.541Z"
    author: codex-sol
    text: "First complete measurement: code head 5660350ce41c1ecaed123c39c73b468f89d278cf, run 43813269377: all 23 jobs passed, 140.35 summed execution runner-minutes, 979s (16m19s) run-created to final job completion. Merged c8 gate passed 100/100/100/100 across 102 files; all 31031 statements, 1357 functions and 13511 branches are hit; refs.ts:299 throw branch has two hits. However quick shard 8 executed for 925s, above the sizing target. Completed log attributes 398.849s to first-class-conflicts.test.ts versus the old 132.605s estimate. Splitting its unchanged 35 cases into 28 core and 7 real-consumer cases using shared fixtures, refreshing affected weights from that log, and retaining N=8. Revised total costs 4650.216s; even ideal seven-way allocation plus setup is 784.317s; eight-way projection is 701.639s (11.69m) including 120s setup. This sizing correction still needs fresh hosted validation."
  - created_at: "2026-11-16T06:20:37.741Z"
    author: codex-sol
    text: "Complete per-job Jobs API timing receipt for run 43813269377 at code head 5660350ce41c1ecaed123c39c73b468f89d278cf. Wall = job creation to completion; execution = start to completion. All 23 succeeded; totals 140.35 execution runner-minutes and 979s overall wall. This measures the first eight-shard placement, before the measured conflict split correction.\n\n| Job | Result | Wall incl. queue (s) | Execution (s) |\n| --- | --- | ---: | ---: |\n| changes | success | 21 | 19 |\n| coverage-merge | success | 35 | 33 |\n| coverage-shard (26, 1) | success | 633 | 603 |\n| coverage-shard (26, 2) | success | 485 | 483 |\n| coverage-shard (26, 3) | success | 558 | 556 |\n| coverage-shard (26, 4) | success | 604 | 535 |\n| coverage-shard (26, 5) | success | 477 | 475 |\n| coverage-shard (26, 6) | success | 325 | 323 |\n| coverage-shard (26, 7) | success | 279 | 276 |\n| coverage-shard (26, 8) | success | 432 | 430 |\n| quick-shard (22, 1) | success | 547 | 545 |\n| quick-shard (22, 2) | success | 695 | 456 |\n| quick-shard (22, 3) | success | 574 | 572 |\n| quick-shard (22, 4) | success | 948 | 388 |\n| quick-shard (22, 5) | success | 412 | 410 |\n| quick-shard (22, 6) | success | 620 | 602 |\n| quick-shard (22, 7) | success | 485 | 483 |\n| quick-shard (22, 8) | success | 927 | 925 |\n| release-gate | success | 124 | 122 |\n| test (22) | success | 9 | 6 |\n| test (26) | success | 5 | 3 |\n| windows-acceptance-launcher (22) | success | 92 | 90 |\n| windows-acceptance-launcher (26) | success | 88 | 86 |"
