    author: codex-sol
    text: "Pushed corrected placement at 5f7215af87de44f2892d9b8d0c332789b2c56c91 after the shared-runner hold check. The committed self-host bundle passed source equality again. All 35 conflict cases retain their original bodies, with 28 core and 7 consumer registrations sharing owned fixtures. Corrected-placement hosted observation ends no later than 06:54 UTC. The expanded linked local command is still running; first-head local 40-test proof and full merged 100% hosted coverage remain separate evidence."
  - created_at: "2026-11-16T06:38:49.542Z"
    author: codex-sol
    text: "Final code measurement: head 5f7215af87de44f2892d9b8d0c332789b2c56c91, https://github.com/unbraind/pm-vcs/actions/runs/43816511270. All 23 CI jobs passed; CodeQL also passed. Summed execution runner-minutes 135.816667; run creation to final job completion 709s (11m49s). Max shard execution 682s (11m22s), max shard wall including queue 684s (11m24s): every shard fits 12 minutes. N=8 versus baseline N=14 (23 versus 35 jobs). Merged coverage is 100/100/100/100 in every one of 102 measured files: all 31031 lines/statements, 1357 functions and 13512 branches hit; the former refs.ts:299 throw branch has two hits. Root cause remains (b), a deterministic coverage gap; all 14 original shards were zero at that location. Thresholds/source scope and merge identities remain unchanged.\n\nLocal follow-up proof passed: npm run typecheck && npm run build:test && npm run lint && PM_TEST_DEPTH=quick node --test --test-concurrency=1 test/ci-shards.test.ts test/first-class-conflicts.test.ts test/first-class-conflicts-consumer.test.ts test/test-environment.test.ts. Linked PM execution exit 0, 59 pass, zero fail/cancel/skip/todo, 829.457s including checks (810.020s tests). Earlier 40-test command covers the coverage-merge fixture, workflow contracts/routing, dependency workflow and refs, also zero failures/skips. Both code commits regenerated selfhost.bundle and passed committed npm run accept:self-host.\n\nPer-job Jobs API receipt (seconds):\n| Job | Result | Wall incl. queue (s) | Execution (s) |\n| --- | --- | ---: | ---: |\n| changes | success | 20 | 18 |\n| coverage-merge | success | 31 | 29 |\n| coverage-shard (26, 1) | success | 573 | 571 |\n| coverage-shard (26, 2) | success | 521 | 519 |\n| coverage-shard (26, 3) | success | 587 | 585 |\n| coverage-shard (26, 4) | success | 476 | 474 |\n| coverage-shard (26, 5) | success | 495 | 494 |\n| coverage-shard (26, 6) | success | 315 | 313 |\n| coverage-shard (26, 7) | success | 504 | 499 |\n| coverage-shard (26, 8) | success | 332 | 326 |\n| quick-shard (22, 1) | success | 574 | 572 |\n| quick-shard (22, 2) | success | 684 | 682 |\n| quick-shard (22, 3) | success | 512 | 510 |\n| quick-shard (22, 4) | success | 502 | 498 |\n| quick-shard (22, 5) | success | 499 | 494 |\n| quick-shard (22, 6) | success | 396 | 394 |\n| quick-shard (22, 7) | success | 415 | 413 |\n| quick-shard (22, 8) | success | 524 | 523 |\n| release-gate | success | 94 | 91 |\n| test (22) | success | 4 | 3 |\n| test (26) | success | 4 | 2 |\n| windows-acceptance-launcher (22) | success | 75 | 73 |\n| windows-acceptance-launcher (26) | success | 67 | 66 |\n\nRisks: full-depth deep-tier runtime is not measured here; duration estimates can drift. The final tracker/archive receipt commit changes no test or implementation source and will trigger fresh CI; no additional CI observation cycle is started for that receipt. No review threads/bot comments were touched, no merge or item closure. Releasing the claim while leaving the item in progress for orchestrator verification."
  - created_at: "2026-11-16T07:22:42.696Z"
    author: codex-sol
    text: "Review round K: verify the requested coverage portability and independent-oracle findings, binding inventory, or property cap contract as applicable; add focused regressions and run the required package gates. Keep this item in progress and release the claim after recording results. No review-thread mutations or merges."
  - created_at: "2026-11-16T07:31:43.385Z"
    author: codex-sol
    text: "Round K: verified the three shared defect classes. runCoverageShard already serializes both native hits and raw source URLs with forward slashes; fileURLToPath handles file URLs, and this merge path has no URL.pathname filesystem access. The existing independent oracle saves original unsharded c8 JSON/summary before merge conversion. Extended it to src/value.ts inside a checkout containing spaces, with explicit portable artifact path assertions. Required pm test gate passed: npm run typecheck; npm run build:test; npm run lint; node --test --test-concurrency=2 test/coverage-merge.test.ts test/raw-coverage.test.ts test/ci-shards.test.ts test/ci-routing.test.ts test/dependency-refresh-workflow.test.ts (19 passed); node --test test/ci-codeql.test.ts (3 passed); git diff --check. Zero failed/skipped. PR #209 was open when inspected; recheck before push. The source snapshot bundle must now be regenerated and its committed form verified by npm run accept:self-host. Project test-result tracking is disabled; comments retain results. No thread mutations."
  - created_at: "2026-11-16T07:35:13.965Z"
    author: codex-sol
    text: "Round K bundle receipt: npm run accept:self-host passed against the stable committed source after bundle regeneration. A preliminary verification overlapped the commit and compared different snapshots; its failure is superseded by the stable-head success. An earlier PM argument rejection selected an older surplus gate; that unrelated run was canceled after all required round K gates passed, and is not counted as passing evidence. Including this receipt and the released claim in a regenerated bundle, then checking the final committed snapshot again before push. No code gates were relaxed. Releasing in progress for orchestrator verification."
